The Z-matrix for the fep calculation needs to be called fepzmat. Then,
to execute an entire fep calculation in a 22-A water cap with T=25C,
just enter
csh fepcmd >& log &

xFEPCAP provides a convenient way to run a single fep calculation
in any directory.

Please see testjob feppolrz for an example of 
Me4N+  -> Me4C in a water cap.
